    "테라코타는 미루면 면이 퍼지거나 타는 일이에요. 초록은 도마 일이라 손이 빌 때 천천히 하면 돼요." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Terracotta means the pasta overcooks or something burns if you wait. Green is prep, so take your time when your hands are free."
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Terracotta means the pasta overcooks or something burns if you wait. Green is prep, so take your time when your hands are free."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "テラコタ色は、後回しにするとパスタが伸びたり焦げたりする作業です。緑は下ごしらえなので、手が空いたときにゆっくりで大丈夫です。"
          }
